    "description": "Anagh is a Technical Consulting Company. Our main focus is to keep our consultants up to date with the latest cutting edge technologies with frequent training sessions free of cost. \n\nOur main focus is towards UI /Front End/Web /PHP/ Mobile development. \nWe have over 82 UI/Front End developers working for us on Full time basis. We pay our consultants continuously even when their contract ends and it is our responsibility to find a next project for the candidates that are on our W2. That's why we provide cutting edge technology training so that we can place our candidates in the current market with better rates.\n\n•Expert in Sourcing and Closing Requirements of High Level Skills like Project Manager/ Architect/ Lead/Analyst/ Developer etc.\n•Liaison between vendors/ clients and candidates.\n•Involved in being a part of the Classroom training conducted in the office on the Advanced Cutting Edge Technologies.\n•Perform salary, Fee, and Contract negotiations with Candidates and Employers.\n•Assist in On-Boarding by performing Credit Checks, Exclusivity Agreements, Agency Agreements, Contracts, Applicant Screening; Employee Orientation, Evaluation, Placement etc.\n•Experience working on Immigration Visa and Non-Immigration Visa Candidates (TN, H1, OPT, CPT, Green Card, US Citizen, L2-EAD, EAD, H1 Transfer) status and tax term like C2C , W-2 consultants.\n\nCurrent Clients Handled: Morgan Stanley, Goldman Sachs, Weather Channel, Barclays, TD Ameritrade, Dominos, CNBC, Comcast, CableVision, Verizon, At&t , TCS, Wipro, HCL, Vanguard Financial, Everyday Health, Cablevision and Whytham Group\n\nWe are open to welcome candidates with experience in the mentioned below skill sets.\nUI Expert with experience in Angular js, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, jQuery, Backbone JS, Node JS, Twitter, Bootstrap, PHP and Mobile Development expertise.\n\nPlease contact me at 732-319-1686/ sarah@anaghtech.com to discuss further about the available positions.\n",
